{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方\n初めて読んでくださった方\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございやす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/12/9301995/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝は寒いです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/12/9301995/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もまりっか元気いっぱい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/12/9301995/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しいfamily名"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントに素敵なのがたくさん><\nどれも素敵でしたが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩みに悩んで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...\n......決めました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「まりっ会」"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/12/9301995/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シンプル！だがそこが良い。\n素敵連打"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/12/9301995/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/12/9301995/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/12/9301995/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらっとさやんとした感じが\n私らしいかななんて思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な素敵なfamily名を\n考えてくださって\nありがとうございました！ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかふぁむ→まりっ会\nに正式に決定します！ぱちぱちぱち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会のみなさん、\nたくさんの応募\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/12/9301995/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会盛り上げるぞー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/12/9301995/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＜がうっちがうっち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}